{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s time for another shift at Joe\u2019s Freedom Burgers - <strong>and this time, you\u2019re not alone.\u00a0</strong>Grab your friends, grab your guns, and get ready to cook\u2026 the American way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/9020c5789d17d05ffaf5566d21a4279d.poster.avif?t=1774358725\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/9020c5789d17d05ffaf5566d21a4279d.webm?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/9020c5789d17d05ffaf5566d21a4279d.mp4?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Joe\u2019s Freedom Burgers\u2122, only the most American of methods are accepted. Former TV chef and proud American patriot\u00a0<strong>Joe Hannes</strong> demands that you prepare every burger using high-powered firearms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/8b0dad8230f72cd021219cde5cc736f2.poster.avif?t=1774358725\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/8b0dad8230f72cd021219cde5cc736f2.webm?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/8b0dad8230f72cd021219cde5cc736f2.mp4?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with pistols, shotguns and ARs, you and up to three friends must work together to feed hungry customers before they storm out.\u00a0Every second counts in the land of the free. Be fast, be precise - and for the love of liberty, don\u2019t burn the burgers. Burnt food means no tips. Or worse: no payment at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/94ca850f7ab78935648dfcab476544f8.poster.avif?t=1774358725\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/94ca850f7ab78935648dfcab476544f8.webm?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/94ca850f7ab78935648dfcab476544f8.mp4?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in the brand-new multiplayer campaign and travel across a totally-not-accurate version of the USA. From the blazing deserts of Texas to the swamps of Florida, serve regionally inspired dishes to increasingly deranged customers. The further you go, the more patriotic gear and cosmetics you\u2019ll unlock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/887d139693da3ed81566906495768352.poster.avif?t=1774358725\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/887d139693da3ed81566906495768352.webm?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780530/extras/887d139693da3ed81566906495768352.mp4?t=1774358725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to serve burgers the only way Joe knows how: <strong>LOUD, FAST, and FULL OF FREEDOM.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video